<p><strong>Subject:</strong> <em>Siivagunner Christmas Comeback Crisis</em><sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-39" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnote-39')">39</a></sup>, Episode 1, <em>Seasonal Return</em>. 2016, Unrated.<br />
